Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.50,0:00:11.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka banyak sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:15.86,0:00:18.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mantel-mantel itu... Kapten?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.07,0:00:21.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita langsung berhadapan\Ndengan musuh kelas kapten sedari awal?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.82,0:00:23.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja. Menghemat waktu kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.28,0:00:27.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak ada gunanya membiarkan mereka\Nmembuat kita semua tertahan di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.07,0:00:30.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makin banyak yang mencari Oni\Nyang ditawan, makin baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.56,0:00:33.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.55,0:00:37.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian semua, duluan saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.53,0:00:38.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kougasaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.27,0:00:41.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mulai sekarang, kau yang memimpin.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.87,0:00:43.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana dengan Guru?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.62,0:00:47.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan menghadapi mereka semua.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.31,0:00:50.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami semua?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.30,0:00:56.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa, Bawahan?\NApa egomu terluka?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:56.78,0:00:59.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata bawahan juga punya ego, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.56,0:01:01.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.90,0:01:05.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu, Muda-sen.\NMelawan sebanyak ini sendirian, sih...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.90,0:01:10.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah dengar legendamu\Nyang membantai seratus orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.54,0:01:15.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, legenda biasanya\Nsudah dibumbui di sana-sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.82,0:01:16.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seratus orang?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.21,0:01:19.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau memang benar, buktikan saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:20.35,0:01:23.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak sebaik itu sampai membiarkan\Nbocah-bocah itu lewat begitu saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.48,0:01:28.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ichinose bagianku. Kalian urus yang lain.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.09,0:01:29.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau saja yang urus yang lain.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.01,0:01:30.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, begitu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.80,0:01:32.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang sepertimu jangan sok memerintah.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.40,0:01:38.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tu-Tubuhku terasa berat?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.27,0:01:41.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tekanan apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:41.34,0:01:44.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Udaranya tiba-tiba ratusan kali lebih berat?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.76,0:01:46.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hebat juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.03,0:01:49.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hawa membunuh yang luar biasa...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:49.72,0:01:51.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa yang terjadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.87,0:01:53.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Entahlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:53.62,0:01:56.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hawa membunuh itu mungkin\Nhanya diarahkan ke musuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.51,0:01:58.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Udaranya terasa sedikit menegang.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.01,0:02:00.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku benar-benar merasa
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.77,0:02:04.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,beruntung sekali dia bukan musuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.09,0:02:07.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lupakan Ichinose.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:08.97,0:02:11.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya, fokus pada Mudano!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.29,0:03:47.23,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Kougasaki, jangan buat aku\Nmengulang perkataanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.35,0:03:49.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita masuk ke laboratorium!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:49.91,0:03:51.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan memerintahku!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.69,0:03:54.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pintu masuknya yang itu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:54.49,0:03:56.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian tidak akan bisa melewati kami!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.56,0:04:04.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Banyak sekali yang datang!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.36,0:04:05.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pokoknya, kudobrak saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.64,0:04:06.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana caranya?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.53,0:04:12.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teknik Gerhana Darah:\NSenapan Dewa Pengubur.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.47,0:04:14.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Senapan Dewa Pengubur.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.37,0:04:17.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dapat menciptakan berbagai jenis senjata api
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.15,0:04:20.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,dengan kekuatan dan ukuran sesuka hati.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:21.03,0:04:24.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika menembak terlalu banyak, penggunanya\Nkekurangan darah, bahkan bisa mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.17,0:04:26.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kena, kalian mati!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:27.01,0:04:28.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bo... Tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.54,0:04:34.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hebat...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.98,0:04:37.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bodoh! Di dalam ada Oni!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.09,0:04:39.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kukurangi kekuatannya, kok!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.34,0:04:43.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cih. Ayo!\NJangan tertinggal!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.27,0:04:45.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kubilang, jangan memerintahku!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.47,0:04:46.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka datang!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.25,0:04:50.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan gentar! Habisi mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.39,0:04:57.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan bergerak!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.13,0:05:01.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mati kau!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:03.65,0:05:05.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bocah ini lincah sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.85,0:05:11.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rokuro, sembunyi di belakangku!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:12.17,0:05:14.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa pak tua ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.25,0:05:18.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pak tua, jangan menghindar!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:18.70,0:05:19.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berisik!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.17,0:05:27.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah! Aku yang pertama!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.37,0:05:34.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berhenti!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.53,0:05:35.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bunuh mereka!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.86,0:05:56.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan begini, untuk sementara\Nmereka tak bisa ke sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:03.32,0:06:06.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku yang pertama.\NKau yang terakhir.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.33,0:06:07.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Diam, mati sana,\Ndasar bodoh berengsek sampah.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.29,0:06:09.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keterlaluan!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.64,0:06:11.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berapa kali kau memaki dalam sedetik?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.33,0:06:14.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Prioritas utama kita\Nmenemukan Oni yang ditawan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.06,0:06:16.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita berpencar berpasangan\Nuntuk mencari mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.57,0:06:19.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa kau yang mengatur?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:19.57,0:06:21.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mudano memercayakannya padaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.90,0:06:24.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Mudano" yang "memintaku".
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.19,0:06:26.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau ini! Sial! Jangan sok pamer!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.32,0:06:28.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pokoknya, berpasang...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.65,0:06:32.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Banyak sekali yang datang lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.10,0:06:36.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begini, kita hanya akan terkuras!\NKita mundur dulu!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.19,0:06:38.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ikuti aku!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.89,0:06:43.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya sudah masuk ke laboratorium.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.39,0:06:48.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau benar-benar mau\Nmelawan sebanyak ini, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.49,0:06:52.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menarik! Sepertinya bakal seru!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.76,0:06:56.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya. Tak perlu berteriak,\Naku bisa mendengarmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.72,0:07:00.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga akan mengakhiri ini dengan cepat.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.90,0:07:06.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Blood Break.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.51,0:07:08.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang akan mengakhiri ini kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.98,0:07:10.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Momosaka Kokuryo.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.93,0:07:13.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengendalikan darah yang keluar dari tubuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.53,0:07:17.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan begini,\Nkau tak bisa memakai darah Oni-mu.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.00,0:07:24.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mudano! Berapa lama\Nlagakmu tadi bisa bertahan?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.38,0:07:26.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu rupanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.80,0:07:34.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya kita sudah lolos dari mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.48,0:07:35.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik, kita bagi pasangan...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.96,0:07:40.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Teman-teman... di mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.08,0:07:43.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rokuro, kau di mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.27,0:07:47.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana aku?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.70,0:07:51.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Astaga, mereka malah tersesat.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.90,0:07:54.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka ini...!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:55.37,0:07:56.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada penyusup di lantai 1!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.21,0:07:58.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cepat!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.79,0:08:06.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tercengang! Tercengang!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.43,0:08:07.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semangat!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.33,0:08:09.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pahamilah! Pahamilah!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.55,0:08:10.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan malu!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.39,0:08:13.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tercengang! Tercengang!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.65,0:08:16.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tercengang! Tercengang!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.98,0:08:27.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belum selesai juga?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.58,0:08:30.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biarkan aku bernyanyi lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.98,0:08:33.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia terlalu lemah, aku belum puas bernyanyi.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.17,0:08:42.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Takkan kubiarkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.35,0:08:45.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau mau pakai jurus itu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.99,0:08:48.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang namanya "ekolokasi" itu, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.85,0:08:54.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemampuan mengetahui jarak, arah,\Ndan ukuran benda lewat pantulan suara.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.86,0:08:56.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan menggemeletukkan gigi,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.66,0:08:59.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Todomeki dapat mengenali benda\Ndalam radius 50 meter.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.18,0:09:04.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ketelitiannya bahkan bisa mengenali\Nsehelai rambut yang jatuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.91,0:09:11.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ekolokasi biasanya sulit dipakai\Ndi tempat yang sangat bising.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.74,0:09:14.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, karena gendang telinganya\Nberkembang secara tak normal,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.96,0:09:18.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Todomeki tetap bisa mengenali benda\Nmeski kebisingan mencapai 120 dB.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.19,0:09:25.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,120 dB setara dengan suara\Nmesin pesawat dari jarak dekat.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.19,0:09:29.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau terlalu sial berhadapan denganku!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.60,0:09:33.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Momoo Senritsu mengendalikan suara.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.45,0:09:37.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Volume maksimalnya mencapai 160 dB,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.02,0:09:41.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,menciptakan gelombang kejut\Nyang bisa melukai tubuh manusia.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.75,0:09:45.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar-benar lawan yang paling buruk bagiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.85,0:09:49.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemampuanku tak bisa dipakai\Ntanpa ekolokasi.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.90,0:09:53.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau itu dikunci, aku bukan hanya\Ntak bisa berbuat apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.75,0:09:57.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saat ini, aku sama sekali tak tahu
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.75,0:10:02.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,tempat seperti apa ini, ada apa saja,\Ndan di mana musuhku berada.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.48,0:10:06.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski gendang telingaku\Nlebih kuat dari orang biasa,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.50,0:10:08.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,luka lebih dari ini bisa berbahaya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.71,0:10:13.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih sudah datang hari ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:14.20,0:10:17.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sayang sekali, tapi setiap konser\Npasti ada akhirnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:18.56,0:10:24.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, kunyanyikan lagu terakhir\Nyang akan membekas di hati kalian!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.08,0:10:29.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena aku yakin kita akan bertemu lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.32,0:10:32.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Yang dengar lagumu biasanya mati,\Njadi mana bisa bertemu lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.99,0:10:35.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biarkan aku bernyanyi!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.41,0:10:36.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.50,0:10:39.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagu terakhir!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.89,0:10:43.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.85,0:10:44.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.81,0:10:45.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.91,0:10:49.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka itu keterlaluan.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.31,0:10:52.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dicari ke mana pun tak ada.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.75,0:10:54.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seenaknya saja bergerak sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.54,0:10:58.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ditambah lagi, ada suara berisik.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.64,0:11:00.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.36,0:11:02.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sedang kesal.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.03,0:11:06.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan berisik dengan suaramu\Nyang memekakkan telinga itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.71,0:11:08.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.25,0:11:12.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Brigade Oni...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.77,0:11:22.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah paham situasinya.\NSi berisik ini biar kuhadapi.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.71,0:11:25.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau di pihak kami, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.61,0:11:28.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana kutahu. Bukan dua-duanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.59,0:11:30.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tak mau jadi beban, kabur saja,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.68,0:11:33.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,atau lawan si gila latihan otot itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.78,0:11:35.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Gila latihan otot"...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.04,0:11:37.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan memujiku begitu!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.43,0:11:41.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu! Kenapa kau\Nyang seenaknya memutuskan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.33,0:11:45.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Senritsu.\NSi masker hitam biar kuhadapi.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.53,0:11:48.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak. Bocah ini bagianku.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.06,0:11:51.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Suara siapa yang kau sebut berisik?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:51.51,0:11:53.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penonton jangan naik ke panggung!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.91,0:11:57.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penontonnya saja tidak ada.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.23,0:12:15.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lawanmu adalah aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.92,0:12:18.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, kuserahkan dia padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.77,0:12:22.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku pindah tempat.\NKau bisa sendirian?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.84,0:12:26.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berisik. Kau di sini malah merepotkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:26.46,0:12:28.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cepat pergi sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.03,0:12:32.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kedengarannya dingin,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.80,0:12:35.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi suaramu tenang dan lembut.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.54,0:12:38.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wajahmu pasti tampan juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.82,0:12:43.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau semua sudah selesai,\Nbiar kuraba wajahmu baik-baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.66,0:12:49.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja tidak mau.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.37,0:12:53.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah. Aku bisa saja membunuh\Nyang ini dulu, baru mengejarnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.81,0:12:54.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kejar dia.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.51,0:12:59.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah kubilang, 'kan? Bocah ini bagianku.\NJangan ikut campur.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.35,0:13:04.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya, iya. Repot juga\Npunya bawahan yang egois.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.62,0:13:09.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan lupa protein\Nsebagai tanda terima kasih, ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.49,0:13:12.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau suka musik apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.89,0:13:19.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rock? Hip-hop?\NLagu anime? Lagu idol?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.37,0:13:24.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak meremehkan lagu idol.\NSemua musik itu indah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:25.03,0:13:29.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana kutahu. Hidupku tak sesantai itu\Nsampai sempat mendengarkan musik.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:29.94,0:13:31.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Salah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.48,0:13:34.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Justru hidup yang kacau butuh musik.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.18,0:13:37.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tes, tes, cek mikrofon.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:38.01,0:13:39.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kupersembahkan satu lagu untukmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.04,0:13:45.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagu ending untuk hidupmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.31,0:13:46.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, terima kasih!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.04,0:13:50.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semprotan Darah Tarian Pembelah!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.37,0:13:53.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hajar... SAY!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.07,0:13:57.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo mulai!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.28,0:14:00.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Voice Flow "Rock"!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.60,0:14:04.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Batas dunia berliku dan penuh kejutan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.57,0:14:07.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ragu sesaat, kau bisa tersisihkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.50,0:14:09.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tanpa jejak tersisa, lenyap begitu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.88,0:14:11.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski menghindar, telingaku tetap kena.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.44,0:14:12.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sulit terbayang diri
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.26,0:14:13.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bahaya kalau mendekat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.44,0:14:14.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,di masa kini
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.58,0:14:16.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang yang merepotkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.36,0:14:17.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan nanti.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.15,0:14:21.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasa gelisah seakan menghabisiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.24,0:14:22.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gelombang tak berujung dari irama vokal.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.88,0:14:28.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di mana pun, aku mau hal yang mustahil.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.73,0:14:30.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Andai hasratku bisa kukejar.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.60,0:14:36.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan kubuka isi hati... mau kulanjutkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.37,0:14:45.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Astaga. Tidakkah menurutmu\Nini keterlaluan?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.16,0:14:50.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ruangan itu seharusnya milikku\Nsebagai kapten,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.06,0:14:53.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi dirancang khusus untuk Senritsu.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.67,0:14:55.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Besarnya hatiku yang memaafkan itu
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.09,0:14:59.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,seperti otot paha depanku ini, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.71,0:15:03.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari suaramu, kau tak terdengar sekekar itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.45,0:15:05.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau menggertak karena aku buta?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.05,0:15:10.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,No, no, no! Yang kumaksud adalah
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.07,0:15:13.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,otot batin!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.37,0:15:21.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tangannya besar sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.64,0:15:24.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hebat juga kau bisa menghindar.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:25.32,0:15:26.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begini?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.55,0:15:29.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kannon Seribu Lengan Otot!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.44,0:15:33.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Otot adalah ekspresi diri terbaik!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.27,0:15:35.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Momokaji Ichiro.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.11,0:15:39.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makin keras berlatih otot,\Nmakin kuat lengan yang bisa diciptakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.63,0:15:42.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kurang latihan,\Nlengannya pun hanya kurus.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.37,0:15:45.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bisa menciptakan seribu lengan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.81,0:15:49.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Besarnya hati sebanding\Ndengan besarnya otot!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.38,0:15:59.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nyaris saja...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.32,0:16:03.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.42,0:16:05.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya kau juga terlatih dengan baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.69,0:16:09.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengan hatiku yang lapang, kumaafkan dosamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.02,0:16:14.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau takkan mati dengan mengenaskan.\NCukup kuremukkan saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.59,0:16:22.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memang keras dan berat, enak pula disentuh.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.99,0:16:25.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau sampai remuk, langsung tamat.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.60,0:16:29.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar, 'kan?\NKuat pula.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.31,0:16:32.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serangan lemah takkan bisa menggoresnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.45,0:16:33.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.27,0:16:36.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.57,0:16:40.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hancur berkeping-keping?\NPadahal tak mungkin hancur semudah itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.72,0:16:43.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekuat apa pun, tak ada artinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.03,0:16:45.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku masih kesal dengan yang tadi,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.37,0:16:48.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,jadi akan kuselesaikan dengan cepat.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.45,0:16:51.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau... apa yang barusan kau lakukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.10,0:16:53.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo? Kau tak melihatnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.40,0:17:00.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Matamu berfungsi,\Ntapi kau tak bisa melihat apa-apa, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:01.90,0:17:05.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tanpa jejak tersisa, lenyap begitu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.18,0:17:09.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lirik untuk harmoni yang ditakdirkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.22,0:17:12.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sulit terbayang diri di masa kini dan nanti.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.14,0:17:15.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasa gelisah seakan menghabisiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:15.65,0:17:17.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gelombang tak berujung dari irama vokal.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.87,0:17:19.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masih belum puas!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.18,0:17:25.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terus bergerak dan cari celah untuk menang!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.04,0:17:32.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Telingaku sakit, berengsek!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:37.61,0:17:39.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Badai Darah Pembelah!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.17,0:17:43.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kekuatannya berkurang, tapi putarannya\Nlebih cepat dan jumlahnya banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:44.00,0:17:46.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti sulit menangkis semuanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.44,0:17:49.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oke. Lagu berikutnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:50.22,0:17:52.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Voice Flow Ballade.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.32,0:18:06.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku gagal lagi, apa pun upayaku\N(kesalahan menghantuiku).
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.74,0:18:17.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setiap kali kehilangan arah\N(aku terus berjuang).
Dialogue: 10,0:18:19.68,0:18:28.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terangilah hidupmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.45,0:18:32.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan ditangkis, tapi dialihkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.30,0:18:33.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mellow, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.36,0:18:37.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masuk ke reff!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.18,0:18:42.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Voice Flow Rock 'n' Roll!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.28,0:18:46.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hidupmu sedang menderita, 'kan?\NSeperti sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.04,0:18:51.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan berpura-pura. Aku ingin menembus
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.70,0:18:58.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,jiwamu yang gersang itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.16,0:19:07.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menyelamlah ke surga bersama suaraku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.42,0:19:14.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Luar biasa, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.92,0:19:17.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia kuat!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.79,0:19:21.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi pasti ada celah untuk menang.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.16,0:19:25.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kena, kalian mati!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.92,0:19:27.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bo... Tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:30.02,0:19:32.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tak boleh berhenti di sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.97,0:19:36.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penonton yang kaku, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.04,0:19:40.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau memang kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.52,0:19:43.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Menyebalkan, tapi kuakui.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.80,0:19:46.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terlambat kau menyadarinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.52,0:19:48.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan berarti akan kubiarkan kau pergi.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.01,0:19:50.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu malah bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.34,0:19:54.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belakangan ini, orang di dekatku makin kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.17,0:19:55.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kesal melihatnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.52,0:20:00.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kukalahkan kau\Ndan menjadi lebih kuat lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.94,0:20:04.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, tapi kau akan jadi batu loncatanku!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.64,0:20:22.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ini benar-benar ingin hidup dari musik.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.08,0:20:22.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ha?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.81,0:20:27.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, setiap emosiku memuncak,\Nkemampuanku aktif tanpa sengaja.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.26,0:20:31.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Musik yang kucintai malah melukai orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.65,0:20:35.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku dibenci dewa musik.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:38.06,0:20:39.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, akhirnya aku sadar!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.50,0:20:44.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tergantung cara memakainya,\Nsuaraku pun bisa menyelamatkan orang!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.58,0:20:49.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa melindungi kalian, para penggemarku,\Ndari Oni yang jahat!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.68,0:20:53.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu, hari ini pun aku bernyanyi!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.62,0:20:56.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak! Biarkan aku bernyanyi!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.20,0:20:59.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa yang penggemarmu, bodoh!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.55,0:21:01.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan tiba-tiba curhat, berengsek!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.14,0:21:06.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di konser, MC itu wajib, tahu!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.21,0:21:07.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,YO!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.13,0:21:10.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagu adalah jiwa,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.13,0:21:13.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,MC adalah jalan hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.11,0:21:18.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial. Aku sama sekali\Ntak bisa melukainya.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.29,0:21:20.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa tak ada cara lain...?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.76,0:21:25.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu rupanya! Ketemu!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:25.05,0:21:27.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cara untuk mengalahkannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.90,0:21:30.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita lanjutkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.79,0:21:35.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Voice Flow Rock 'n' Roll!
